                - Flow chart
                    - I think that I can do this by having each node let us jump to a point of the script. At that label we wipe any booleans that we generate in the scene, so that we're seeing it as though it's the first time again. Jumping
                        back and forth might mean that some branches can't be unlocked but if we've unlocked the node we can jump past the lock anyway - any scenes past there we already know that we hit the flag to unlock it.
                    - If we jump to a node and choose a different place to go to then we need to swap things around. So let's say on A-1 we go Barbara, Cat, Eddie, then later jump back to A-1-1 and choose someone different. If it's Graves we 
